  "system": {
    "identifier": "offensive-dodge",
    "description": "<p>You take a reverse grip on your weapon and attempt to strike before you are struck. You gain a +2 bonus to AC against the triggering attack and you can make a melee taijutsu attack against the triggering creature. On a hit you deal your [Weapon damage] + 2d8.</p>\n<p>Chain 1: if you score a hit, you gain temporary hit points equal to the result of your weapons damage die.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and damage by 1d8. If this jutsu is cast at B-Rank or higher, increase the AC bonus to +3.</p>",
